  },
  "seo": {
    "metatags": {
      "og:title": "StackNext documentation",
      "og:description": "Local-first runtime debugging, diagnostics and regression evidence for Next.js."
    }
  },
  "markdown": {
    "instructions": "StackNext documentation is organized by audience. Human-facing guides live under /guides, /cli and /ai-agents. Version-matched package reference documentation lives under /packages and also ships inside each npm package. AI agents should prefer the local files at node_modules/@stacknext/<package>/docs/ for the installed version, and use this site for concepts and cross-package workflows. Mintlify generates /llms.txt, /llms-full.txt and Markdown versions of every page; see /ai-agents/llms-txt. Diagnostic findings are evidence, not confirmed root causes; regression comparisons are deterministic and report-only."
  }
